      "contact_id": "agxzfnViZXItdm9pY2VyFAsSB0NvbnRhY3QYgMCi1uncrgsM",
      "content": "Okay, so I am in Florida, I'm moving to Texas in the Fortworth area. I have all my stuff in the sixteen foot parts container, which is going to be delivered to cu flo the one closest to where I am downtown Fort Worth, so I wanted to see how much it would be to move half of my belongings from the pos container into the cou north and then the other half into my apartment downtown Fort Worth.",
