      "name": "Sabine Beaugris",
      "time": "2026-09-12T20:22:01.890506",
      "type": "transcript"
    },
    {
      "content": "Gotcha. So, I guess, it really just depends on where the apartment and the storage unit are going to be located in terms of time between the two and then if they fall within our free service zone other than that we're an hourly service, we have a 2.5 hour minimum for every job that we do. I would say unloading half of a half of a sixteen foot pod is gonna take not much time at all. I mean we might be somewhere between the minimum which is two and a half hours and three and a half hours of work total. And then again, it just depends on where you kind of fall within the free service on if there's any trip fees associated.",
